  "reason": "The strongest evidence is RNA-only multiprofile PCA with avgpool (0.591 acc), while image-only ResNet50 is weak (0.208), leaving uncertainty about whether image provides complementary signal. config_018 keeps the best RNA profile/aggregation and adds ResNet50 with simple concat fusion, directly testing the fusion/model-setting effect without changing the RNA encoder or aggregation. This is the best next step because it exploits the best unimodal direction while efficiently determining whether multimodal complexity is warranted before tuning fusion or image encoders."
